# The parsed intermediate: every raw sample of every admitted cycle, 63 MB.
# Regenerated by `python -m pipeline.ingest` in about a minute. What IS
# committed is what comes out the far side — data/processed/features.csv (86 KB)
# and the artifacts — which is enough to reproduce the model and run the app
# from a clone with no download at all.
